'','','','','','','','','','ayatena adatlosdi','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','msct','A transmission medium designed for high-speed data transfers over long distances. Cable modem services and Digital Subscriber Line (DSL) are examples of broadband networks.','','','','2018-12-22 20:06:53'),(89538,2,'','diacritic','tunoyvgv dikanohesgi','','','n','','','','ᏚᏃᏴᎬ ᏗᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ','','','','','','','','','','','tunoyvgv dikanohesgi','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','msct','A mark placed over, under, or through a character, usually to indicate a change in phonetic value from the unmarked state.','','','','2018-12-22 20:06:53'),(89539,2,'','Loose XAML','nidalistanvna XAML','','','n','','','','ᏂᏓᎵᏍᏔᏅᎾ XAML','','','','','','','','','','','nidalistanvna nullnullnullnull','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','msct','A feature that allows you to open any XAML file on your hard disk (or a hyperlink on a web page) and run it within a browser without compilation.','','','','2018-12-22 20:06:53'),(89540,2,'','drop-down menu','eladi yigvnedi gowelanavi','','','n','','','','ᎡᎳᏗ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ','','','','','','','','','','','eladi yigvnedi gowelanavi','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','msct','A menu that drops from the menu bar when requested and remains open without further action until the user closes it or chooses a menu item.','','','','2018-12-22 20:06:53'),(89541,2,'','transfer','ahvsdi','','','n','','','','ᎠᎲᏍᏗ','','','','','','','','','','','ahvsdi','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','msct','The movement of information from one location to another, either within a computer (as from a disk drive to memory), between a computer and an external device (as between a file server and a computer on a network), or between separate computers.','','','','2018-12-22 20:06:53'),(89542,2,'','proxy server','nav diyadohihi','','','n','','','','ᎾᎥ ᏗᏯᏙᎯᎯ','','','','','','','','','','','nav diyadohihi','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','msct','A server located on a network between client software, such as a Web browser, and another server. It intercepts all requests to the server to determine whether it can fulfill them itself. If not, it forwards the request to another server.','','','','2018-12-22 20:06:53'),(89543,2,'','tip','adanohisehi','','','n','','','','ᎠᏓᏃᎯᏎᎯ','','','','','','','','','','','adanohisehi','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','msct','A type of note that helps users apply the techniques and procedures described in the text to their specific needs. A tip suggests alternative methods that may not be obvious and helps users understand the benefits and capabilities of the product. A tip is not essential to the basic understanding of the text.','','','','2018-12-22 20:06:54'),(89544,2,'','copyright','gilo utseli gesv','','','n','','','','ᎩᎶ ᎤᏤᎵ ᎨᏒ','','','','','','','','','','','gilo utseli gesv','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','msct','A method of protecting the rights of an originator of a creative work, such as a text, a piece of music, a painting, or a computer program, through law.','','','','2018-12-22 20:06:54'),(89545,2,'','home page','tsuwenvsv uganvdatvi','','','n','','','','ᏧᏪᏅᏒ ᎤᎦᏅᏓᏛᎢ','','','','','','','','','','','tsuwenvsv uganvdatvi','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','msct','A document that serves as a starting point in a hypertext system. On the World Wide Web, an entry page for a set of Web pages and other files in a Web site. The home page is displayed by default when a visitor navigates to the site using a Web browser.','','','','2018-12-22 20:06:54'),(89546,2,'','relationship','diligodi','','','n','','','','ᏗᎵᎪᏗ','','','','','','','','','','','diligodi','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','msct','An association established between common fields (columns) in two tables. A relationship can be one-to-one, many-to-many, or one-to-many.','','','','2018-12-22 20:06:54'),(102394,3,NULL,'He\'s winning; he\'s beating him at a game','adatlosga',NULL,NULL,'vt',NULL,NULL,NULL,'ᎠᏓᏠᏍᎦ','gadatlosga','ᎦᏓᏠᏍᎦ','hadatlohi','ᎭᏓᏠᎯ','udatlohisdi','ᎤᏓᏠᎯᏍᏗ','udatlosvɂi','ᎤᏓᏠᏒᎢ','adatlosgoɂi','ᎠᏓᏠᏍᎪᎢ','adatlosga',NULL,NULL,'gadatlosga','hadatlohi','udatlohisdi','udatlosvi',NULL,'adatlosga',NULL,'gadatlosga','hadatlohi','udatlohisdi','udatlosvɂi','adatlosgoɂi','VRB',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-01 22:31:46'),(102395,0,NULL,'He\'s telling him','ganosea',NULL,NULL,'vt',NULL,NULL,NULL,'ᎦᏃᏎᎠ','jinosea','ᏥᏃᏎᎠ','hinohisi','ᎯᏃᎯᏏ','unosehdi','ᎤᏃᏎᏗ','unoselvi','ᎤᏃᏎᎸᎢ','ganosehoi','ᎦᏃᏎᎰᎢ','ganosea','','','tsinosea','hinohisi','unosedi','unoselvi','ganosehoi','ganoseɂa',NULL,'jinoseɂa','hinohisi','unosehdi','unoselvɂi','ganosehoɂi','VRB',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-10-13 22:18:02'),(102309,4,NULL,'harbor, ship\'s harbor','ditaladisdiyi, tsiyu ditaladisdiyi',NULL,NULL,'n','Acts 27:12  And because the <u>haven</u> was not commodious to winter in, the more part advised to depart thence also...','Getsinvsidv nunadvnelidolvi  27:12  <u>ditaladisdiyihno</u> nosvna gesv uhna ugoladiyvdiyi, utli iyanii uninetsvgi nasquo nahna uniyvwidvdiyi','ᎨᏥᏅᏏᏛ  ᏄᎾᏛᏁᎵᏙᎸᎢ  27:12, <u>ᏗᏔᎳᏗᏍᏗᏱᏃ</u> ᏃᏒᎾ ᎨᏒ ᎾᎿ ᎤᎪᎳᏗᏴᏗᏱ, ᎤᏟ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ ᎤᏂᏁᏨᎩ ᎾᏍᏉ ᎾᎿ ᎤᏂᏴᏫᏛᏗᏱ','ᏗᏔᎳᏗᏍᏗᏱ, ᏥᏳ ᏗᏔᎳᏗᏍᏗᏱ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'ditaladisdiyi, tsiyu ditaladisdiyi',NULL,'getsinvsidv  nunadvnelidolvi  nullnullnullnullnullnulli ditaladisdiyino nosvna gesv nahna ugoladiyvdiyinulli utli iyanii uninetsvgi nasquo nahna uniyvwidvdiyi',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'CNT',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-05-16 17:50:36'),(102310,4,NULL,'anchor','ganahisdohdi','diganahisdohdi','ᏗᎦᎾᎯᏍᏙᏗ','n','Which hope we have as an <u>anchor</u> of the soul...','Quola aniquilu tsuwohwelanelvhi 6:19  Nasgi udugi gvhdi nasgiya adanvdo <u>ganahisdohdi</u> tsigi','ᏉᎳ ᎠᏂᏈᎷ ᏧᏬᏪᎳᏁᎸᎯ  6:19, ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏚᎩ ᎬᏗ ᎨᏒ ᎾᏍᎩᏯ ᎠᏓᏅᏙ <u>ᎦᎾᎯᏍᏙᏗ</u> ᏥᎩ','ᎦᎾᎯᏍᏙᏗ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'ganahisdodi','diganahisdodi',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'CNT',NULL,NULL,NU