idonidohi','analitsidonidohi','quola tsuwowelanvhi taline timadi  tsuwowelanelvhi 4:5 nullnullnulli   nihisgini heyatahiyu gesesdi nigav nitsadvhnadegvinulli hvnidiyu gesesdi higiliyogvinulli detsalvwisdanehesdi nullnullnullalitsidonidohinullnullnullnulli tsulvwisdanedi gesvi',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'CNT',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-05-16 19:27:21'),(102393,5,'unetselvgi','he is commanding him, he is ordering him','kanetseha',NULL,NULL,'vt','These things <u>I command you,</u> that ye love one another. [John 15:17]','Nasgi hia nusdi <u>itsvnetseha,</u> ditsadagehiyu iyulisdodiyi.','ᎾᏍᎩ ᎯᎠ ᏄᏍᏗ <u>ᎢᏨᏁᏤᎭ</u> ᏗᏣᏓᎨᎯᏳ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗᏱ. [ᏣᏂ ᎤᏬᏪᎳᏅᎯ 15:17]','ᎧᏁᏤᎭ','tsinetseha','ᏥᏁᏤᎭ','hinetsv','ᎯᏁᏨ','unetsedi','ᎤᏁᏤᏗ','unetselvi','ᎤᏁᏤᎸᎢ','kanetsehoi','ᎧᏁᏤᎰᎢ','kanetseha',NULL,NULL,'tsinetseha','hinetsv','unetsedi','unetselvi','kanetsehoi','kanetseha',NULL,'tsiɂnetseha','hihnetsv','uhnetsedi','uhnetselvɂi','kanetsehoɂi','CNT',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2022-05-07 20:01:50'),(102401,0,NULL,'in his/her heart','unawiyi','duninawiyi','ᏚᏂᎾᏫᏱ','n','hat Christ may dwell <u>in your hearts</u> by faith;\" Ephesians 3:17','\"Nasgi Galonedv uneladisdiyi <u>ditsinawiyi</u> gohiyudi gvdodi gesvi;\" Equisa Anehi 3:17','\"ᎾᏍᎩ ᎦᎶᏁᏛ ᎤᏁᎳᏗᏍᏗᏱ <u>ᏗᏥᎾᏫᏱ</u> ᎪᎯᏳᏗ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎨᏒᎢ\"; ᎡᏈᏌ ᎠᏁᎯ 3:17','ᎤᎾᏫᏱ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'unawiyi','duninawiyi','nullnasgi galonedv uneladisdiyi nullnullnullditsinawiyinullnullnullnulli gohiyudi gvdodi gesvinullnulli equisa anehi nullnullnullnull','','','','','','unawiyi','duninawiyi',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'CNT',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-01-24 23:14:34'),(112900,2,NULL,'precious stone, gemstone','galvquodi nvya','digalvquodi nvya','ᏗᎦᎸᏉᏗ ᏅᏯ','n','And the foundations of the wall of the city were garnished with all manner of <u>precious stones.</u>','degagusdavhno asohyv gaduhvi degosuisdvgi nudalesv <u>digalvquodi nvya</u>','Revelation 21:19 ᏕᎦᎫᏍᏓᎥᏃ ᎠᏐᏴ ᎦᏚᎲᎢ ᏕᎪᏑᎢᏍᏛᎩ ᏄᏓᎴᏒ <u>ᏗᎦᎸᏉᏗ ᏅᏯ</u>','ᎦᎸᏉᏗ ᏅᏯ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL