or counting in a series  between 22 - 29, such as dates or ages.','hisgitsone',NULL,NULL,NULL,'All citizens age <u>twenty-five</u> (25) or older residing outside the boundaries... [CONSTITUTION OF THE CHEROKEE NATION 1999]','Nigavquo Tsalagihi anehi <u>hisgitsone</u> (25) iyundetiyvdv ale udanilage yigi doya didla Tsalagihi Ayehli... [Tsalagihi Ayehli Gagusdvdi, 1999]','ᏂᎦᎥᏉ ᏣᎳᎩᎯ ᎠᏁᎯ <u>ᎯᏍᎩᏦᏁ</u> (25) ᎢᏳᎾᏕᏘᏴᏛ ᎠᎴ ᎤᏓᏂᎳᎨ ᏱᎩ ᏙᏯ ᏗᏜ ᏣᎳᎩᎯ ᎠᏰᎵ... [ᏣᎳᎩᎯ ᎠᏰᎵ ᎦᎫᏍᏛᏗ, 1999]','ᎯᏍᎩᏦᏁ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'hiʔsgitsoʔne',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'hsbc',NULL,NULL,'numbers, cardinal',NULL,'2022-06-21 02:03:14'),(112971,3,NULL,'twenty-six (26); special number used for counting in a series  between 22 - 29, such as dates or ages.','sudalitsone',NULL,NULL,'adj','He/she (turned) four on <u>the 26th</u> of this month. [Beginning Cherokee]','Nvhgi nudetiya <u>su²³dạ³lʔtsoʔne</u> sinv tsigesv. [Beginning Cherokee]','ᏅᎩ ᏄᏕᏘᏯ <u>ᏑᏓᎵᏦᏁ</u> ᏏᏅ ᏥᎨᏒ. [Beginning Cherokee]','ᏑᏓᎵᏦᏁ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'su²³dạ³lʔtsoʔne',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'hsbc',NULL,NULL,'numbers, cardinal',NULL,'2022-06-21 02:09:09'),(112973,5,NULL,'twenty-seven (27); special number used for counting in a series  between 22 - 29, such as dates or ages.','gahlgwoitsone',NULL,NULL,'adj','I believe John is about <u>twenty-seven.</u> [Beginning Cherokee]','Tsani <u>galiquoitsone</u> iyudetiyvda gelia. [Beginning Cherokee]','ᏣᏂ <u>ᎦᎵᏉᎢᏦᏁ</u> ᎢᏳᏕᏘᏴᏓ ᎨᎵᎠ. [Beginning Cherokee]','ᎦᎵᏉᎢᏦᏁ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'gahl²gwo²³ʔitsoʔne',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'hsbc',NULL,NULL,'numbers, cardinal',NULL,'2022-06-21 02:02:37'),(112974,9,NULL,'twenty-eight (28); special number used for counting in a series  between 22 - 29, such as dates or ages.','nelatsone',NULL,NULL,'adj','February which is different has just <u>twenty-eig